{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"report_supported\": \"partly\",\n  \"judge_supported\": \"partly\",\n  \"report_quotes\": [\n    \"We included 18 patients with PD (Table S1) who exhibited severe motor fluctuations and varying deficits of gait and balance.\",\n    \"Four participants exhibited frequent episodes of freezing of gait, predominantly whilst turning.\",\n    \"Visual inspection of LFP spectral features revealed that these periods correlated with the emergence of predominant low-beta signatures in bilateral STN LFP, along with partial co-activation of knee extensor muscles that reflected the incapacity to shift bodyweight (Fig. 8A).\",\n    \"Analysis of spectral components showed increased low-beta power during freezing periods compared to walking or standing, although the predominance of these signatures mirrored the severity of freezing events in each participant, and the frequency and duration of events28 (Fig. 8C).\",\n    \"NOTE: This preprint reports new research that has not been certified by peer review and should not be used to guide clinical practice.\"\n  ],\n  \"judge_quotes\": [\n    \"We exploited this platform in 18 patients with Parkinson’s disease, which allowed us to demonstrate that the subthalamic nucleus encodes the initiation, termination, and vigor of leg muscle activation.\",\n    \"Four participants exhibited frequent episodes of freezing of gait, predominantly whilst turning.\",\n    \"20 patients with Parkinson’s disease were recruited for the study.\",\n    \"Overall, 17 patients were retained for analyses on the neurorobotic platform and 12 for gait experiments.\",\n    \"NOTE: This preprint reports new research that has not been certified by peer review and should not be used to guide clinical practice.\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"报告的说法为 partly：全文确实支持4名患者出现频繁FOG，并明确报告冻结期间双侧STN低beta活动增加，以及膝伸肌部分共同激活；同时，所提供的文本明确标记为未经同行评审的medRxiv预印本。但是，将整个研究描述为4人研究不符合全文。摘要和Results明确报告18名患者，4人是出现频繁FOG的亚组。Methods还说明最初招募20人，最终不同实验分析分别保留17人和12人。因此，把FOG亚组人数当作整个研究的样本量，遗漏了会改变研究规模判断的关键限定。指控者的说法为 partly：其关于18名患者和4名频繁FOG患者属于亚组的描述有全文依据；但关于2022年发表于Science Translational Medicine、属于正式同行评审论文的说法，无法从所提供的全文得到证实。相反，所提供版本明确声明其为尚未经过同行评审的预印本。全文没有提供后来正式发表的期刊信息，因此不能仅凭该文件判定其是否后来发表为正式期刊论文。综上，报告在样本量描述上存在实质性错误，但其FOG结果描述及对所提供文本发表状态的标记有依据；指控者正确指出了样本量混淆，但其关于正式期刊发表状态的判断超出了全文能够支持的范围。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c597829b-1ea2-4b2b-8553-6e7f39209e86", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T140507037896Z", "elapsed_seconds": 99.64, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T14:06:46.685686+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c269804039269276e4bd214c4eaa9be565ed8ad975b9b1cff13824aa87422a7c", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline